dev-1.0

This source distribution adapts the public pplx-decider implementation from
perplexity-ai/pplx-decider-v1.1-27b, source release
db124e5056059be396ec5ba69b97a33dd6adb815, under Apache License 2.0.
The original upstream artifact NOTICE is preserved in LICENSES/.

The trained checkpoint is an NF4 LoRA adapter and a 255-option FP32 decision
readout for Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B-Base, revision
dc7cdfe2ee4154fa7e30f5b51ca41bfa40174e68. The Qwen base is separately licensed
under Apache License 2.0; no affiliation with or endorsement by Qwen or
Perplexity is implied.

Local changes include Qwen3.5-0.8B compatibility, NF4 LoRA training, exact CPU
encoding and token-budget microbatch collation, first-run artifact verification,
and a release inference wrapper. The 255-option readout, noncausal full-attention
method and supervised decision training originate from the upstream source.

